Hello.  Yes, I downloaded the WC Spoiler file 5.35 from ab20.  Yes, I
have a weak spirit.  No, I don't want to discuss that part. :]

The file I downloaded was encoded with the lharc compressor, and when
I unlharced it on my Amiga, I got a spoiler file that was about 206 K
long.  All of my text viewers (fv, more, muchmore, textviewer in
DiskMaster) tell me that the end (the last page) is right in the middle
of a sentence in CONFUSED SCROLL EFFECTS, under Charging.  I get one
line of description, and then and end-of-file.  Anyway, according to the
table of contents, that's only section 49, with another 15 left to go.

I have not yet downloaded a new copy, but I should be able to do that
soon.  I am assuming that the file is supposed to be complete.  Please
tell me if it isn't, eh?

So my question is, has anyone else had the same problem?  And, If it
isn't me or my machine, is there some way to get a complete file on ab20
for those of us with weak hearts/not much spare time/lots of curiosity?

I don't have access to rec.games.hack through my news reader, but I do
read comp.sys.amiga.games regularly, and of course, if I get replies by
